EMS" INCLUDE ADJUSTMENTS FOR LOWER OF COST OR MARKET ("LCM"), IMPAIRMENTS AND REFINERY EXIT COSTS.'}{'symbol': 'LYB', 'date': '2023-04-28 05:00:00', 'title': 'LYONDELLBASELL AND VEOLIA RESTRUCTURE THEIR PLASTICS RECYCLING JOINT VENTURE QCP', 'text': 'HOUSTON , APRIL 28, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LYONDELLBASELL (NYSE: LYB) AND VEOLIA BELGIUM HAVE SIGNED AN AGREEMENT TO RESTRUCTURE THE OWNERSHIP OF QUALITY CIRCULAR POLYMERS (QCP) BV RECYCLING FACILITIES, WITH LOCATIONS IN BELGIUM AND THE NETHERLANDS. VEOLIA WILL SELL ITS 50% SHARE TO LYONDELLBASELL WHICH WILL BECOME 100% OWNER OF QCP.'}